    "body": "Demand data point (counts only): a third-party library converter (Dutchman 0.3.1-rc.7, Fusion tool library to `.camtools`) can already read reamers and counterbores, but has no CamCraft kind to write them to: in a real vendor library it dropped **2,487 reamers and 42 counterbores** for that reason alone. Once these kinds exist (and `.camtools` stores them), such libraries convert without loss. No library content used here.",
